{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Slay All Evil, Spare None!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700320/extras/eExist01-6.gif?t=1746350283\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u3010Polished to Perfection\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25b6 Frame-perfect animations with realistic attack recovery.  <br>\u25b6 Dodge cancels flow smoothly, input response is precise.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700320/extras/eExist01-3.gif?t=1746350283\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25b6 Use the first chapter of the game to create this demo, and experience the intense mass combat scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25b6 This demo allows you to experience all of the protagonist's skills, identical to the full version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700320/extras/eExist01-5.gif?t=1746350283\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Blade as Art</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chain 26 skills through light/heavy attacks:  <br>\u25b6 Dash-dodge seamlessly into offense.  <br>\u25b6 &quot;Dragonfly Skim&quot; (aerial combo), &quot;Cloud Clamp&quot; (crowd control), &quot;Triple Sweep&quot; (leg breaker), &quot;Black Shear&quot; (crushing blow).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Difficulty &amp; Flow</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Three Modes</strong>  <br>\u25b6 Wanderer: Slower enemies for beginners.  <br>\u25b6 Demon Slayer: True designer's vision.  <br>\u25b6 Formless: Double enemy density, hardcore only.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.c